5,1,1,talk,Toshio,,I believe we should start by examining the actual utility of our facilities. I will look into the post-occupancy review ratings and the booking data for specialist and general rooms.,"{""words"":30,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Victoria,,"I agree that utility is key. To understand the full impact of these projects, I will look into the timetable records on rooms out of service and the post-occupancy review ratings.","{""words"":31,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,George,,I think we must consider the human element and the operational burden. I will look into the staffing posts since the hiring freeze and the bench technicians' weekly manual routines.,"{""words"":30,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Mizuki,,"To ensure we have a realistic timeline and budget, I will look into the weather days in the site diaries and the decade of delivery schedules by project rationale.","{""words"":29,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
